<div class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Help Centre</span>
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <p>Find answers to the most common questions below.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <div class="page-content">

    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;">

      <details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:24px 0;">
        <summary style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--black);cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
          Are your products vegan and cruelty-free?
          <span style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--text-muted);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.85;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:0.9375rem;">Yes. Every product is 100% vegan and cruelty-free. We never test on animals and use no animal-derived ingredients.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:24px 0;">
        <summary style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--black);cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
          Are your products safe for sensitive skin?
          <span style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--text-muted);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.85;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:0.9375rem;">Our formulas are crafted with gentle, dermatologist-approved ingredients. We recommend a patch test on the inside of your wrist for 24 hours before full application.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:24px 0;">
        <summary style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--black);cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
          How long before I see results?
          <span style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--text-muted);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.85;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:0.9375rem;">Most customers notice visible improvements within 2–4 weeks of consistent use. For best results, use morning and evening for at least 4–6 weeks.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:24px 0;">
        <summary style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--black);cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
          Do you offer free shipping?
          <span style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--text-muted);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.85;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:0.9375rem;">Yes. Free standard shipping on all US orders over $50. Standard delivery takes 5–8 business days. Express options are available at checkout.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:24px 0;">
        <summary style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--black);cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
          Can I return an opened product?
          <span style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--text-muted);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.85;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:0.9375rem;">For hygiene reasons, we cannot accept returns on opened products. If your product arrives damaged or defective, contact us within 7 days for a full replacement or refund.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:24px 0;">
        <summary style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--black);cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
          What is PDRN and how does it work?
          <span style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--text-muted);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.85;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:0.9375rem;">PDRN (Polydeoxyribonucleotide) is a regenerative ingredient originally used in Korean medical clinics. It activates the skin's natural repair cycle, stimulates collagen, and strengthens the skin barrier. Our serum contains 10,000ppm.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="padding:24px 0;">
        <summary style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--black);cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
          How do I contact customer support?
          <span style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--text-muted);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.85;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:0.9375rem;">Email us at <a href="mailto:support@{{ shop.domain }}" style="color:var(--gold);">support@{{ shop.domain }}</a> — we respond within 24 hours, Monday to Friday.</p>
      </details>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>

